    <h3>Jotform Prefill Map - Example Configuration</h3>
    <p>Copy the JSON below and replace the <code>qXX_</code> keys with your actual Jotform field prefill keys.</p>
  </div>

  <pre class="jfp-example"><span class="bracket">{</span>
  <span class="comment">// ===== PERSONAL DETAILS =====</span>
